rial; font-size: 6px; direction: ltr; margin-left: 24px;\"><div class=\"zw-line-div\" doc-id=\"line_06563218769740373\" style=\"box-sizing: content-box; outline: 0px; z-index: 4; white-space: nowrap; position: relative; height: 22px; margin-bottom: 10.6667px;\"><div class=\"zw-line-content\" style=\"outline: 0px;\"><span class=\"zw-bullet zw-bullet-order-list\" style=\"outline: 0px; unicode-bidi: isolate; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Aptos; letter-spacing: 0px; padding-right: 12px; position: relative; left: 0px;\">5.</span><span class=\"zw-portion zw-text-portion\" data-text-len=\"80\" doc-id=\"segment_06345251847714962\" style=\"outline: 0px; font-family: Aptos; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); position: relative; unicode-bidi: plaintext; left: 0px;\">Voluntary resignation requires 30 days\' notice, as per the employment agreement.</span><span class=\"EOP-readonly EOP\" doc-id=\"segment_06694280409102817\" style=\"outline: 0px; width: 14px; font-family: Aptos; font-size: 12pt; position: relative; unicode-bidi: plaintext; left: 0px; display: inline !important;\">&nbsp;</span></div></div></p><ul type=\"disc\">\r\n</ul>','2026-11-05 21:44:29.211397',34),(87,2,'Working Hours & Attendance ','<p class=\"zw-paragraph\" data-width=\"624\" data-textformat=\"{&quot;size&quot;:12}\" role=\"listitem\" doc-id=\"para_004575452185654516\" node-id=\"node_08411836260819913\" style=\"outline: 0px; position: relative; color: rgb(13, 13, 13); font-family: Arial; font-size: 6px; direction: ltr; margin-left: 24px;\"><div class=\"zw-line-div\" doc-id=\"line_05842066484916901\" style=\"box-sizing: content-box; outline: 0px; z-index: 4; white-space: nowrap; position: relative; height: 22px; padding-bottom: 10.6667px;\"><div class=\"zw-line-content\" style=\"outline: 0px;\"><span class=\"zw-bullet zw-bullet-order-list\" style=\"outline: 0px; unicode-bidi: isolate; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Aptos; letter-spacing: 0px; padding-right: 12px; position: relative; left: 0px;\">1.</span><