1994407565\" node-id=\"node_024538704389808708\" style=\"outline: 0px; position: relative; color: rgb(13, 13, 13); font-family: Arial; font-size: 6px; direction: ltr; margin-left: 24px;\"><div class=\"zw-line-div\" doc-id=\"line_0831185294739725\" style=\"box-sizing: content-box; outline: 0px; z-index: 4; white-space: nowrap; position: relative; height: 22px; padding-bottom: 10.6667px;\"><div class=\"zw-line-content\" style=\"outline: 0px;\"><span class=\"zw-bullet zw-bullet-order-list\" style=\"outline: 0px; unicode-bidi: isolate; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Aptos; letter-spacing: 0px; padding-right: 12px; position: relative; left: 0px;\">3.</span><span class=\"zw-portion zw-text-portion\" data-text-len=\"30\" doc-id=\"segment_09567865762709852\" style=\"outline: 0px; font-family: Aptos; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); position: relative; unicode-bidi: plaintext; left: 0px;\">Night shift: Monday to Friday.</span><span class=\"EOP-readonly EOP\" doc-id=\"segment_0901449716473614\" style=\"outline: 0px; width: 14px; font-family: Aptos; font-size: 12pt; position: relative; unicode-bidi: plaintext; left: 0px; display: inline !important;\">&nbsp;</span></div></div></p><p class=\"zw-paragraph\" data-width=\"624\" data-textformat=\"{&quot;size&quot;:12}\" role=\"listitem\" doc-id=\"para_04774678406113555\" node-id=\"node_018897061818336047\" style=\"outline: 0px; position: relative; color: rgb(13, 13, 13); font-family: Arial; font-size: 6px; direction: ltr; margin-left: 24px;\"><div class=\"zw-line-div\" doc-id=\"line_04491969735788137\" style=\"box-sizing: content-box; outline: 0px; z-index: 4; white-space: nowrap; position: relative; height: 22px; padding-bottom: 10.6667px;\"><div class=\"zw-line-content\" style=\"outline: 0px;\"><span class=\"zw-bullet zw-bullet-order-list\" style=\"outline: 0px; unicode-bidi: isolate; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Aptos; letter-spacing: 0px; padding-right: 12px; position: relative; left: 0px;\">4.</span><span class=\"zw-portio