x;\"><span class=\"zw-bullet zw-bullet-order-list\" style=\"outline: 0px; unicode-bidi: isolate; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Aptos; letter-spacing: 0px; padding-right: 12px; position: relative; left: 0px;\">3.</span><span class=\"zw-portion zw-text-portion\" data-text-len=\"56\" doc-id=\"segment_07679112129320109\" style=\"outline: 0px; font-family: Aptos; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); position: relative; unicode-bidi: plaintext; left: 0px;\">Maternity Leave: Up to 6 months, subject to eligibility.</span><span class=\"EOP-readonly EOP\" doc-id=\"segment_04850920029930442\" style=\"outline: 0px; width: 14px; font-family: Aptos; font-size: 12pt; position: relative; unicode-bidi: plaintext; left: 0px; display: inline !important;\">&nbsp;</span></div></div></p><p class=\"zw-paragraph\" data-width=\"624\" data-textformat=\"{&quot;size&quot;:12}\" role=\"listitem\" doc-id=\"para_004935995424463413\" node-id=\"node_07025730296770542\" style=\"outline: 0px; position: relative; color: rgb(13, 13, 13); font-family: Arial; font-size: 6px; direction: ltr; margin-left: 24px;\"><div class=\"zw-line-div\" doc-id=\"line_023315416579907555\" style=\"box-sizing: content-box; outline: 0px; z-index: 4; white-space: nowrap; position: relative; height: 22px; padding-bottom: 10.6667px;\"><div class=\"zw-line-content\" style=\"outline: 0px;\"><span class=\"zw-bullet zw-bullet-order-list\" style=\"outline: 0px; unicode-bidi: isolate; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Aptos; letter-spacing: 0px; padding-right: 12px; position: relative; left: 0px;\">4.</span><span class=\"zw-portion zw-text-portion\" data-text-len=\"81\" doc-id=\"segment_048478045599119424\" style=\"outline: 0px; font-family: Aptos; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); position: relative; unicode-bidi: plaintext; left: 0px;\">Sabbatical Leave: 1–2 months for eligible employees who have completed two years.</span><span class=\"EOP-readonly EOP\" doc-id=\"segment_06872667057699565\" style=\"outline: 0px; width: 14px; font-family: Aptos; font-size: 12pt; position: relative; unicode-bidi: plaintext; left: 0px; display: inline !important;\">&nbsp;</span></div></div></p><p class=\"zw-paragraph\" data-width=\"624\" data-textformat=\"{&quot;size&quot;:12}\" role=\"listitem\" doc-id=\"para_008588031922291772\" node-id=\"node_040529248914898697\" style=\"outline: 0px; position: relative; color: rgb(13, 13, 13); font-family: Arial; font-size: 6px; direction: ltr; margin-left: 24px;\"><div class=\"zw-line-div\" doc-id=\"line_05146054905334959\" style=\"box-sizing: content-box; outline: 0px; z-index: 4; white-space: nowrap; position: relative; height: 22px; margin-bottom: 10.6667px;\"><div class=\"zw-line-content\" style=\"outline: 0px;\"><span class=\"zw-bullet zw-bullet-order-list\" style=\"outline: 0px; unicode-bidi: isolate; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Aptos; letter-spacing: 0px; padding-right: 12px; position: relative; left: 0px;\">5.</span><span class=\"zw-portion zw-text-portion\" data-text-len=\"59\" doc-id=\"segment_06129066310837956\" style=\"outline: 0px; font-family: Aptos; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); position: relative; unicode-bidi: plaintext; left: 0px;\">Unused CL is eligible for encashment based on Basic Salary.</span><span class=\"EOP-readonly EOP\" doc-id=\"segment_03386154779232533\" style=\"outline: 0px; width: 14px; font-family: Aptos; font-size: 12pt; position: relative; unicode-bidi: plaintext; left: 0px; display: inline !important;\">&nbsp;</span></div></div></p>','2026-11-05 21:44:29.217268',34),(89,4,'Performance & Employee Responsibilities ','<p class=\"zw-paragraph\" data-width=\"624\" data-textformat=\"{&quot;size&quot;:12}\" role=\"listitem\" doc-id=\"para_020307202440494565\" node-id=\"node_024398599048176806\" style=\"outline: 0px; position: relative; color: rgb(13, 13, 13); font-family: Arial; font-size: 6px; direction: ltr; margin-left: 24px;\"><div class=\"zw-line-div\" doc-id=\"line_0002391919207831661\" style=\"box-sizing: content-box; outline: 0px; z-index: 4; white-space: nowrap; position: relative; height: 22px; padding-bottom: 10.6667px;\"><div class=\"zw-line-content\" style=\"outline: 0px;\"><span class=\"zw-bullet zw-bullet-order-list\" style=\"outline: 0px; unicode-bidi: isolate; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Aptos; letter-spacing: 0px; padding-right: 12px; position: relative; left: 0px;\">1.</span><span class=\"zw-portion zw-text-portion\" data-text-len=\"80\" doc-id=\"segment_05688814841460972\" style=\"outline: 0px; font-family: Aptos; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); position: relative; unicode-bidi: plaintext; left: 0px;\">Employees must meet the performance standards defined by their respective teams.</span><span class=\"EOP-readonly EOP\" doc-id=\"segment_024437483340754373\" style=\"outline: 0px; width: 14px; font-family: Aptos; font-size: 12pt; position: relative; unicode-bidi: plaintext; left: 0px; display: inline !important;\">&nbsp;</span></div></div></p><p class=\"zw-paragraph\" data-width=\"624\" data-textformat=\"{&quot;size&quot;:12}\" role=\"listitem\" doc-id=\"para_0031122363077907056\" node-id=\"node_0457521427651024\" style=\"outline: 0px; position: relative; color: rgb(13, 13, 13); font-family: Arial; font-size: 6px; direction: ltr; margin-left: 24px;\"><div class=\"zw-line-div\" doc-id=\"line_05971189979337909\" style=\"box-sizing: content-box; outline: 0px; z-index: 4; white-space: nowrap; position: relative; height: 22px; padding-bottom: 10.6667px;\"><div class=\"zw-line-content\" style=\"outline: 0px;\"><span class=\"zw-bullet zw-bullet-order-list\" style=\"outline: 0px; unicode-bidi: isolate; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Aptos; letter-spacing: 0px; padding-right: 12px; position: relative; left: 0px;\">2.</span><span class=\"zw-portion zw-text-portion\" data-text-len=\"59\" doc-id=\"segment_03047376984025869\" style=\"outline: 0px; font-family: Aptos; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); position: relative; unicode-bidi: plaintext; left: 0px;\">Managers may initiate a Performance Improvement Plan (PIP).</span><span class=\"EOP-readonly EOP\" doc-id=\"segment_02029397105081273\" style=\"outline: 0px; width: 14px; font-family: Aptos; font-size: 12pt; position: relative; unicode-bidi: plaintext; left: 0px; display: inline !important;\">&nbsp;</span></div></div></p><p class=\"zw-paragraph\" data-width=\"624\" data-textformat=\"{&quot;size&quot;:12}\" role=\"listitem\" doc-id=\"para_043883310525517427\" node-id=\"node_066817191969747\" style=\"outline: 0px; position: relative; color: rgb(13, 13, 13); font-family: Arial; font-size: 6px; direction: ltr; margin-left: 24px;\"><div class=\"zw-line-div\" doc-id=\"line_01315699766143772\" style=\"box-sizing: content-box; outline: 0px; z-index: 4; white-space: nowrap; position: relative; height: 22px; padding-bottom: 10.6667px;\"><div class=\"zw-line-content\" style=\"outline: 0px;\"><span class=\"zw-bullet zw-bullet-order-list\" style=\"outline: 0px; unicode-bidi: isolate; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Aptos; letter-spacing: 0px; padding-right: 12px; position: relative; left: 0px;\">3.</span><span class=\"zw-portion zw-text-portion\" data-text-len=\"61\" doc-id=\"segment_09950118512491698\" style=\"outline: 0px; font-family: Aptos; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); position: relative; unicode-bidi: plaintext; left: 0px;\">Employees are expected to demonstrate continuous improvement.</span><span class=\"EOP-readonly EOP\" doc-id=\"segment_040397736871853196\" style=\"outline: 0px; width: 14px; font-family: Aptos; font-size: 12pt; position: relative; unicode-bidi: plaintext; left: 0px; display: inline !important;\">&nbsp;</span></div></div></p><p class=\"zw-paragraph\" data-width=\"624\" data-textformat=\"{&quot;size&quot;:12}\" role=\"listitem\" doc-id=\"para_05172401979415057\" node-id=\"node_03805232771067111\" style=\"outline: 0px; position: relative; color: rgb(13, 13, 13); font-family: Arial; font-size: 6px; direction: ltr; margin-left: 24px;\"><div class=\"zw-line-div\" doc-id=\"line_09093510940368119\" style=\"box-sizing: content-box; outline: 0px; z-index: 4; white-space: nowrap; position: relative; height: 22px; padding-bottom: 10.6667px;\"><div class=\"zw-line-content\" style=\"outline: 0px;\"><span class=\"zw-bullet zw-bullet-order-list\" style=\"outline: 0px; unicode-bidi: isolate; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Aptos; letter-spacing: 0px; padding-right: 12px; position: relative; left: 0px;\">4.</span><span class=\"zw-portion zw-text-portion\" data-text-len=\"54\" doc-id=\"segment_036788494945432404\" style=\"outline: 0px; font-family: Aptos; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); position: relative; unicode-bidi: plaintext; left: 0px;\">Failure to show improvement may result in termination.</span><span class=\"EOP-readonly EOP\" doc-id=\"segment_005997431017741328\" style=\"outline: 0px; width: 14px; font-family: Aptos; font-size: 12pt; position: relative; unicode-bidi: plaintext; left: 0px; display: inline !important;\">&nbsp;</span></div></div></p><p class=\"zw-paragraph\" data-width=\"624\" data-textformat=\"{&quot;size&quot;:12}\" role=\"listitem\" doc-id=\"para_09268077164129557\" node-id=\"node_05537033815902923\" style=\"outline: 0px; position: relative; color: rgb(13, 13, 13); font-family: Arial; font-size: 6px; direction: ltr; margin-left: 24px;\"><div class=\"zw-line-div\" doc-id=\"line_06824745271178171\" style=\"box-sizing: content-box; outline: 0px; z-index: 4; white-space: nowrap; position: relative; height: 22px; margin-bottom: 10.6667px;\"><div class=\"zw-line-content\" style=\"outline: 0px;\"><span class=\"zw-bullet zw-bullet-order-list\" style=\"outline: 0px; unicode-bidi: isolate; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Aptos; letter-spacing: 0px; padding-right: 12px; position: relative; left: 0px;\">5.</span><span class=\"zw-portion zw-text-portion\" data-text-len=\"75\" doc-id=\"segment_012861595838059026\" style=\"outline: 0px; font-family: Aptos; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); position: relative; unicode-bidi: plaintext; left: 0px;\">Employees must follow company rules, procedures and reporting requirements.</span><span class=\"EOP-readonly EOP\" doc-id=\"segment_06063401652021797\" style=\"outline: 0px; width: 14px; font-family: Aptos; font-size: 12pt; position: relative; unicode-bidi: plaintext; left: 0px; display: inline !important;\">&nbsp;</span></div></div></p>','2026-11-05 21:44:29.220286',34),(90,5,' Information Security & HIPAA Compliance ','<p class=\"zw-paragraph\" data-width=\"624\" data-textformat=\"{&quot;size&quot;:12}\" role=\"listitem\" doc-id=\"para_05959891305532018\" node-id=\"node_06673441657343401\" style=\"outline: 0px; position: relative; color: rgb(13, 13, 13); font-family: Arial; font-size: 6px; direction: ltr; margin-left: 24px;\"><div class=\"zw-line-div\" doc-id=\"line_06287262625992119\" style=\"box-sizing: content-box; outline: 0px; z-index: 4; white-space: nowrap; position: relative; height: 22px; padding-bottom: 10.6667px;\"><div class=\"zw-line-content\" style=\"outline: 0px;\"><span class=\"zw-bullet zw-bullet-order-list\" style=\"outline: 0px; unicode-bidi: isolate; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Aptos; letter-spacing: 0px; padding-right: 12px; position: relative; left: 0px;\">1.</span><span class=\"zw-portion zw-text-portion\" data-text-len=\"59\" doc-id=\"segment_04021335989779178\" style=\"outline: 0px; font-family: Aptos; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); position: relative; unicode-bidi: plaintext; left: 0px;\">Maintain confidentiality of company and client information.</span><span class=\"EOP-readonly EOP\" doc-id=\"segment_08307197011208238\" style=\"outline: 0px; width: 14px; font-family: Aptos; font-size: 12pt; position: relative; unicode-bidi: plaintext; left: 0px; display: inline !important;\">&nbsp;</span></div></div></p><p class=\"zw-paragraph\" data-width=\"624\" data-textformat=\"{&quot;size&quot;:12}\" role=\"listitem\" doc-id=\"para_0070223081753374\" node-id=\"node_040946233669993426\" style=\"outline: 0px; position: relative; color: rgb(13, 13, 13); font-family: Arial; font-size: 6px; direction: ltr; margin-left: 24px;\"><div class=\"zw-line-div\" doc-id=\"line_010538490352240337\" style=\"box-sizing: content-box; outline: 0px; z-index: 4; white-space: nowrap; position: relative; height: 22px; padding-bottom: 10.6667px;\"><div class=\"zw-line-content\" style=\"outline: 0px;\"><span class=\"zw-bullet zw-bullet-order-list\" style=\"outline: 0px; unicode-bidi: isolate; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Aptos; letter-spacing: 0px; padding-right: 12px; position: relative; left: 0px;\">2.</span><span class=\"zw-portion zw-text-portion\" data-text-len=\"70\" doc-id=\"segment_007841381255111346\" style=\"outline: 0px; font-family: Aptos; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); position: relative; unicode-bidi: plaintext; left: 0px;\">Access Protected Health Information (PHI) only when required for work.</span><span class=\"EOP-readonly EOP\" doc-id=\"segment_04781973802945758\" style=\"outline: 0px; width: 14px; font-family: Aptos; font-size: 12pt; position: relative; unicode-bidi: plaintext; left: 0px; display: inline !important;\">&nbsp;</span></div></div></p><p class=\"zw-paragraph\" data-width=\"624\" data-textformat=\"{&quot;size&quot;:12}\" role=\"listitem\" doc-id=\"para_011471463403786963\" node-id=\"node_09088297479980132\" style=\"outline: 0px; position: relative; color: rgb(13, 13, 13); font-family: Arial; font-size: 6px; direction: ltr; margin-left: 24px;\"><div class=\"zw-line-div\" doc-id=\"line_07232721455764488\" style=\"box-sizing: content-box; outline: 0px; z-index: 4; white-space: nowrap; position: relative; height: 22px; padding-bottom: 10.6667px;\"><div class=\"zw-line-content\" style=\"outline: 0px;\"><span class=\"zw-bullet zw-bullet-order-list\" style=\"outline: 0px; unicode-bidi: isolate; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Aptos; letter-spacing: 0px; padding-right: 12px; position: relative; left: 0px;\">3.</span><span class=\"zw-portion zw-text-portion\" data-text-len=\"43\" doc-id=\"segment_08771500045799616\" style=\"outline: 0px; font-family: Aptos; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); position: relative; unicode-bidi: plaintext; left: 0px;\">Never share passwords or login credentials.</span><span class=\"EOP-readonly EOP\" doc-id=\"segment_003569891029384975\" style=\"outline: 0px; width: 14px; font-family: Aptos; font-size: 12pt; position: relative; unicode-bidi: plaintext; left: 0px; display: inline !important;\">&nbsp;</span></div></div></p><p class=\"zw-paragraph\" data-width=\"624\" data-textformat=\"{&quot;size&quot;:12}\" role=\"listitem\" doc-id=\"para_09659474661971261\" node-id=\"node_06400001060964232\" style=\"outline: 0px; position: relative; color: rgb(13, 13, 13); font-family: Arial; font-size: 6px; direction: ltr; margin-left: 24px;\"><div class=\"zw-line-div\" doc-id=\"line_05123681366025842\" style=\"box-sizing: content-box; outline: 0px; z-index: 4; white-space: nowrap; position: relative; height: 22px; padding-bottom: 10.6667px;\"><div class=\"zw-line-content\" style=\"outline: 0px;\"><span class=\"zw-bullet zw-bullet-order-list\" style=\"outline: 0px; unicode-bidi: isolate; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Aptos; letter-spacing: 0px; padding-right: 12px; position: relative; left: 0px;\">4.</span><span class=\"zw-portion zw-text-portion\" data-text-len=\"73\" doc-id=\"segment_013605659703593942\" style=\"outline: 0px; font-family: Aptos; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); position: relative; unicode-bidi: plaintext; left: 0px;\">Do not install unauthorized software or download unapproved applications.</span><span class=\"EOP-readonly EOP\" doc-id=\"segment_048342905415865445\" style=\"outline: 0px; width: 14px; font-family: Aptos; font-size: 12pt; position: relative; unicode-bidi: plaintext; left: 0px; display: inline !important;\">&nbsp;</span></div></div></p><p class=\"zw-paragraph\" data-width=\"624\" data-textformat=\"{&quot;size&quot;:12}\" role=\"listitem\" doc-id=\"para_03199919768991226\" node-id=\"node_09096021867643604\" style=\"outline: 0px; position: relative; color: rgb(13, 13, 13); font-family: Arial; font-size: 6px; direction: ltr; margin-left: 24px;\"><div class=\"zw-line-div\" doc-id=\"line_02348807283133938\" style=\"box-sizing: content-box; outline: 0px; z-index: 4; white-space: nowrap; position: relative; height: 22px; margin-bottom: 10.6667px;\"><div class=\"zw-line-content\" style=\"outline: 0px;\"><span class=\"zw-bullet zw-bullet-order-list\" style=\"outline: 0px; unicode-bidi: isolate; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Aptos; letter-spacing: 0px; padding-right: 12px; position: relative; left: 0px;\">5.</span><span class=\"zw-portion zw-text-portion\" data-text-len=\"81\" doc-id=\"segment_015518331629864734\" style=\"outline: 0px; font-family: Aptos; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); position: relative; unicode-bidi: plaintext; left: 0px;\">Report suspected data breaches immediately to HR or the HIPAA Compliance Officer.</span><span class=\"EOP-readonly EOP\" doc-id=\"segment_04180424301787472\" style=\"outline: 0px; width: 14px; font-family: Aptos; font-size: 12pt; position: relative; unicode-bidi: plaintext; left: 0px; display: inline !important;\">&nbsp;</span></div></div></p>','2026-11-05 21:44:29.222595',34),(91,6,'Code of Conduct & Misconduct ','<p class=\"zw-paragraph\" data-width=\"624\" data-textformat=\"{&quot;size&quot;:12}\" role=\"listitem\" doc-id=\"para_024855313139454582\" node-id=\"node_007214685974844859\" style=\"outline: 0px; position: relative; color: rgb(13, 13, 13); font-family: Arial; font-size: 6px; direction: ltr; margin-left: 24px;\"><div class=\"zw-line-div\" doc-id=\"line_022666804648431882\" style=\"box-sizing: content-box; outline: 0px; z-index: 4; white-space: nowrap; position: relative; height: 22px; padding-bottom: 10.6667px;\"><div class=\"zw-line-content\" style=\"outline: 0px;\"><span class=\"zw-bullet zw-bullet-order-list\" style=\"outline: 0px; unicode-bidi: isolate; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Aptos; letter-spacing: 0px; padding-right: 12px; position: relative; left: 0px;\">1.</span><span class=\"zw-portion zw-text-portion\" data-text-len=\"61\" doc-id=\"segment_00403654583393408\" style=\"outline: 0px; font-family: Aptos; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); position: relative; unicode-bidi: plaintext; left: 0px;\">Fraud, theft, dishonesty and bribery are strictly prohibited.</span><span class=\"EOP-readonly EOP\" doc-id=\"segment_04684952022637576\" style=\"outline: 0px; width: 14px; font-family: Aptos; font-size: 12pt; position: relative; unicode-bidi: plaintext; left: 0px; display: inline !important;\">&nbsp;</span></div></div></p><p class=\"zw-paragraph\" data-width=\"624\" data-textformat=\"{&quot;size&quot;:12}\" role=\"listitem\" doc-id=\"para_02499692255618048\" node-id=\"node_06467745631169795\" style=\"outline: 0px; position: relative; color: rgb(13, 13, 13); font-family: Arial; font-size: 6px; direction: ltr; margin-left: 24px;\"><div class=\"zw-line-div\" doc-id=\"line_023176701490595308\" style=\"box-sizing: content-box; outline: 0px; z-index: 4; white-space: nowrap; position: relative; height: 22px; padding-bottom: 10.6667px;\"><div class=\"zw-line-content\" style=\"outline: 0px;\"><span class=\"zw-bullet zw-bullet-order-list\" style=\"outline: 0px; unicode-bidi: isolate; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Aptos; letter-spacing: 0px; padding-right: 12px; position: relative; left: 0px;\">2.</span><span class=\"zw-portion zw-text-portion\" data-text-len=\"75\" doc-id=\"segment_031950198245219885\" style=\"outline: 0px; font-family: Aptos; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); position: relative; unicode-bidi: plaintext; left: 0px;\">Unauthorized absence and willful neglect of work are considered misconduct.</span><span class=\"EOP-readonly EOP\" doc-id=\"segment_07674829690190325\" style=\"outline: 0px; width: 14px; font-family: Aptos; font-size: 12pt; position: relative; unicode-bidi: plaintext; left: 0px; display: inline !important;\">&nbsp;</span></div></div></p><p class=\"zw-paragraph\" data-width=\"624\" data-textformat=\"{&quot;size&quot;:12}\" role=\"listitem\" doc-id=\"para_022513572771732215\" node-id=\"node_010042279197088277\" style=\"outline: 0px; position: relative; color: rgb(13, 13, 13); font-family: Arial; font-size: 6px; direction: ltr; margin-left: 24px;\"><div class=\"zw-line-div\" doc-id=\"line_09852994190447959\" style=\"box-sizing: content-box; outline: 0px; z-index: 4; white-space: nowrap; position: relative; height: 22px; padding-bottom: 10.6667px;\"><div class=\"zw-line-content\" style=\"outline: 0px;\"><span class=\"zw-bullet zw-bullet-order-list\" style=\"outline: 0px; unicode-bidi: isolate; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Aptos; letter-spacing: 0px; padding-right: 12px; position: relative; left: 0px;\">3.</span><span class=\"zw-portion zw-text-portion\" data-text-len=\"71\" doc-id=\"segment_05129252477564498\" style=\"outline: 0px; font-family: Aptos; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); position: relative; unicode-bidi: plaintext; left: 0px;\">Insubordination and disobedience of lawful instructions are prohibited.</span><span class=\"EOP-readonly EOP\" doc-id=\"segment_07222986042574993\" style=\"outline: 0px; width: 14px; font-family: Aptos; font-size: 12pt; position: relative; unicode-bidi: plaintext; left: 0px; display: inline !important;\">&nbsp;</span></div></div></p><p class=\"zw-paragraph\" data-width=\"624\" data-textformat=\"{&quot;size&quot;:12}\" role=\"listitem\" doc-id=\"para_04554997140489496\" node-id=\"node_06865414976422811\" style=\"outline: 0px; position: relative; color: rgb(13, 13, 13); font-family: Arial; font-size: 6px; direction: ltr; margin-left: 24px;\"><div class=\"zw-line-div\" doc-id=\"line_08350727072682927\" style=\"box-sizing: content-box; outline: 0px; z-index: 4; white-space: nowrap; position: relative; height: 22px; padding-bottom: 10.6667px;\"><div class=\"zw-line-content\" style=\"outline: 0px;\"><span class=\"zw-bullet zw-bullet-order-list\" style=\"outline: 0px; unicode-bidi: isolate; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Aptos; letter-spacing: 0px; padding-right: 12px; position: relative; left: 0px;\">4.</span><span class=\"zw-portion zw-text-portion\" data-text-len=\"67\" doc-id=\"segment_05000784165910955\" style=\"outline: 0px; font-family: Aptos; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); position: relative; unicode-bidi: plaintext; left: 0px;\">Physical or psychological harassment of colleagues is unacceptable.</span><span class=\"EOP-readonly EOP\" doc-id=\"segment_0667482331553236\" style=\"outline: 0px; width: 14px; font-family: Aptos; font-size: 12pt; position: relative; unicode-bidi: plaintext; left: 0px; display: inline !important;\">&nbsp;</span></div></div></p><p class=\"zw-paragraph\" data-width=\"624\" data-textformat=\"{&quot;size&quot;:12}\" role=\"listitem\" doc-id=\"para_03792125219328464\" node-id=\"node_046711971737359836\" style=\"outline: 0px; position: relative; color: rgb(13, 13, 13); font-family: Arial; font-size: 6px; direction: ltr; margin-left: 24px;\"><div class=\"zw-line-div\" doc-id=\"line_049770576751479856\" style=\"box-sizing: content-box; outline: 0px; z-index: 4; white-space: nowrap; position: relative; height: 22px; margin-bottom: 10.6667px;\"><div class=\"zw-line-content\" style=\"outline: 0px;\"><span class=\"zw-bullet zw-bullet-order-list\" style=\"outline: 0px; unicode-bidi: isolate; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Aptos; letter-spacing: 0px; padding-right: 12px; position: relative; left: 0px;\">5.</span><span class=\"zw-portion zw-text-portion\" data-text-len=\"58\" doc-id=\"segment_07577830232829681\" style=\"outline: 0px; font-family: Aptos; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); position: relative; unicode-bidi: plaintext; left: 0px;\">Major misconduct may result in termination without notice.</span><span class=\"EOP-readonly EOP\" doc-id=\"segment_05569355289202496\" style=\"outline: 0px; width: 14px; font-family: Aptos; font-size: 12pt; position: relative; unicode-bidi: plaintext; 