e: 0px; width: 14px; font-family: Aptos; font-size: 12pt; position: relative; unicode-bidi: plaintext; left: 0px; display: inline !important;\">&nbsp;</span></div></div></p><p class=\"zw-paragraph\" data-width=\"624\" data-textformat=\"{&quot;size&quot;:12}\" role=\"listitem\" doc-id=\"para_06459501502625121\" node-id=\"node_08977890452366157\" style=\"outline: 0px; position: relative; color: rgb(13, 13, 13); font-family: Arial; font-size: 6px; direction: ltr; margin-left: 24px;\"><div class=\"zw-line-div\" doc-id=\"line_05389974226500668\" style=\"box-sizing: content-box; outline: 0px; z-index: 4; white-space: nowrap; position: relative; height: 22px; padding-bottom: 10.6667px;\"><div class=\"zw-line-content\" style=\"outline: 0px;\"><span class=\"zw-bullet zw-bullet-order-list\" style=\"outline: 0px; unicode-bidi: isolate; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Aptos; letter-spacing: 0px; padding-right: 12px; position: relative; left: 0px;\">4.</span><span class=\"zw-portion zw-text-portion\" data-text-len=\"59\" doc-id=\"segment_014826559736115097\" style=\"outline: 0px; font-family: Aptos; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); position: relative; unicode-bidi: plaintext; left: 0px;\">Ripped, revealing and inappropriate clothing is prohibited.</span><span class=\"EOP-readonly EOP\" doc-id=\"segment_017710878252290285\" style=\"outline: 0px; width: 14px; font-family: Aptos; font-size: 12pt; position: relative; unicode-bidi: plaintext; left: 0px; display: inline !important;\">&nbsp;</span></div></div></p><p class=\"zw-paragraph\" data-width=\"624\" data-textformat=\"{&quot;size&quot;:12}\" role=\"listitem\" doc-id=\"para_021114601840971847\" node-id=\"node_04669564439081565\" style=\"outline: 0px; position: relative; color: rgb(13, 13, 13); font-family: Arial; font-size: 6px; direction: ltr; margin-left: 24px;\"><div class=\"zw-line-div\" doc-id=\"line_06355294712411679\" style=\"box-sizing: content-box; outline: 0px; z-index: 4; white-space: nowrap; position: relative; height: 22px; margin-bottom: 10.6667px;\"><div class=\"zw-line-content\" style=\"outline: 0px;\"><span class=\"zw-bullet zw-bullet-order-list\" style=\"outline: 0px; unicode-bidi: isolate; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Aptos; letter-spacing: 0px; padding-right: 12px; position: relative; left: 0px;\">5.</span><span class=\"zw-portion zw-text-portion\" data-text-len=\"63\" doc-id=\"segment_04109909814546373\" style=\"outline: 0px; font-family: Aptos; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); position: relative; unicode-bidi: plaintext; left: 0px;\">Repeated dress code violations may lead to disciplinary action.</span><span class=\"EOP-readonly EOP\" doc-id=\"segment_0837149156843652\" style=\"outline: 0px; width: 14px; font-family: Aptos; font-size: 12pt; position: relative; unicode-bidi: plaintext; left: 0px; display: inline !important;\">&nbsp;</span></div></div></p>','2026-11-05 21:44:29.227301',34),(93,8,'Personal Loan Policy','<p><span class=\"zw-bullet zw-bullet-order-list\" style=\"outline: 0px; unicode-bidi: isolate; color: rgb(13, 13, 13); letter-spacing: 0px; white-space: nowrap; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Aptos; padding-right: 12px; position: relative; left: 0px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 1.</span><span class=\"zw-portion zw-text-portion\" data-text-len=\"61\" doc-id=\"segment_0740333454585931\" style=\"outline: 0px; font-family: Aptos; font-size: 12pt; white-space: nowrap; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); position: relative; unicode-bidi: plaintext; left: 0px;\">Employees who have completed 3 years of service are eligible.</span><span class=\"EOP-readonly EOP\" doc-id=\"segment_02467010126496748\" style=\"outline: 0px; width: 14px; color: rgb(13, 13, 13); white-space: nowrap; font-family: Aptos; font-size: 12pt; position: relative; unicode-bidi: plaintext; left: 0px; display: inline !important;\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"zw-paragraph\" data-width=\"624\" data-textformat=\"{&quot;size&quot;:12}\" role=\"listitem\" doc-id=\"para_011827194021813436\" node-id=\"node_09092599920186685\" style=\"outline: 0px; position: relative; color: rgb(13, 13, 13); font-family: Arial; font-size: 6px; direction: ltr; margin-left: 24px;\"><p class=\"zw-line-div\" doc-id=\"line_05527626430572194\" style=\"box-sizing: content-box; outline: 0px; z-index: 4; white-space: nowrap; position: relative; height: 22px; padding-bottom: 10.6667px;\"><p class=\"zw-line-content\" style=\"outline: 0px;\"><span class=\"zw-bullet zw-bullet-order-list\" style=\"outline: 0px; unicode-bidi: isolate; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Aptos; letter-spacing: 0px; padding-right: 12px; position: relative; left: 0px;\">2.</span><span class=\"zw-portion zw-text-portion\" data-text-len=\"64\" doc-id=\"segment_010106192998245589\" style=\"outline: 0px; font-family: Aptos; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); position: relative; unicode-bidi: plaintext; left: 0px;\">Loans are provided for specified personal needs and emergencies.</span><span class=\"EOP-readonly EOP\" doc-id=\"segment_01917140640796754\" style=\"outline: 0px; width: 14px; font-family: Aptos; font-size: 12pt; position: relative; unicode-bidi: plaintext; left: 0px; display: inline !important;\">&nbsp;</span></p></p></p><p class=\"zw-paragraph\" data-width=\"624\" data-textformat=\"{&quot;size&quot;:12}\" role=\"listitem\" doc-id=\"para_045816441034481636\" node-id=\"node_01398382755168881\" style=\"outline: 0px; position: relative; color: rgb(13, 13, 13); font-family: Arial; font-size: 6px; direction: ltr; margin-left: 24px;\"><p class=\"zw-line-div\" doc-id=\"line_004124408424259085\" style=\"box-sizing: content-box; outline: 0px; z-index: 4; white-space: nowrap; position: relative; height: 22px; padding-bottom: 10.6667px;\"><p class=\"zw-line-content\" style=\"outline: 0px;\"><span class=\"zw-bullet zw-bullet-order-list\" style=\"outline: 0px; unicode-bidi: isolate; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Aptos; letter-spacing: 0px; padding-right: 12px; position: relative; left: 0px;\">3.</span><span class=\"zw-portion zw-text-portion\" data-text-len=\"64\" doc-id=\"segment_011262321561280786\" style=\"outline: 0px; font-family: Aptos; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); position: relative; unicode-bidi: plaintext; left: 0px;\">Maximum loan eligibility is 2 times the employee\'s gross salary.</span><span class=\"EOP-readonly EOP\" doc-id=\"segment_06005908602904745\" style=\"outline: 0px; width: 14px; font-family: Aptos; font-size: 12pt; position: relative; unicode-bidi: plaintext; left: 0px; display: inline !important;\">&nbsp;</span></p></p></p><p class=\"zw-paragraph\" data-width=\"624\" data-textformat=\"{&quot;size&quot;:12}\" role=\"listitem\" doc-id=\"para_06184168804513868\" node-id=\"node_03901646998296484\" style=\"outline: 0px; position: relative; color: rgb(13, 13, 13); font-family: Arial; font-size: 6px; direction: ltr; margin-left: 24px;\"><p class=\"zw-line-div\" doc-id=\"line_07641696164788316\" style=\"box-sizing: content-box; outline: 0px; z-index: 4; white-space: nowrap; position: relative; height: 22px; padding-bottom: 10.6667px;\"><p class=\"zw-line-content\" style=\"outline: 0px;\"><span class=\"zw-bullet zw-bullet-order-list\" style=\"outline: 0px; unicode-bidi: isolate; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Aptos; letter-spacing: 0px; padding-right: 12px; position: relative; left: 0px;\">4.</span><span class=\"zw-portion zw-text-portion\" data-text-len=\"70\" doc-id=\"segment_026947134963887265\" style=\"outline: 0px; font-family: Aptos; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); position: relative; unicode-bidi: plaintext; left: 0px;\">Repayment tenure ranges from 6 to 12 months through salary deductions.</span><span class=\"EOP-readonly EOP\" doc-id=\"segment_020401197935981474\" style=\"outline: 0px; width: 14px; font-family: Aptos; font-size: 12pt; position: relative; unicode-bidi: plaintext; left: 0px; display: inline !important;\">&nbsp;</span></p></p></p><p class=\"zw-paragraph\" data-width=\"624\" data-textformat=\"{&quot;size&quot;:12}\" role=\"listitem\" doc-id=\"para